Z||000012||mrfiero||06-25-2001||07:14 PM||||I'm delivering a Fiero to Tim at Fiero Parts & Appraisals in Old Orchard Beach, ME.  I am about to leave for Michigan to deliver an '88 GT and will head for Maine when I return......I'll probably leave Friday and get there Sunday/Monday.   I was supposed to be there in time for the show last week, but I had car problems.<P>It's purely a business trip......along with the car I am dropping off and picking up a bunch of big parts that are too big/expensive to ship.  I'll be swinging through Omaha, NE; Dyersville, IA; Lansing, MI; Detroit, MI (again); Poughkeepsie, NY; OOB, ME; Indianapolis, IN; Ft. Riley, KS; Sedgwick, KS then home to Denver.  It'll be a long drive, but well worth it! <P>||||reg||1
